Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fade(500,500)\blur3}本字幕由悠哈璃羽字幕社製作，僅用於日語交流使用\N請勿私自二次上傳及用作商業用途
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fade(500,500)\blur3}翻譯:阿恁&雪音  校對:狗糧山  時軸:懶鬼後裔樰七  後期:冷麵珺  壓製:zoe  海報:狗糧山
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:05.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室  好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:11.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這傢伙是我的髮小  叫火鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是不死鳥的後裔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:17.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不死鳥的…後裔？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.19,0:00:22.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我換了工作  從上週起調到這家公司的營業部了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:23.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我叫冬月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,火鳥先生看上去很開心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.97,0:00:30.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,其實是因為  有個命懸一線的項目起死回生了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.06,0:00:33.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,畢竟我可是不死鳥的後裔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.78,0:00:40.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你說換了工作  上一份工作是幹什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:41.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,上一份工作？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.45,0:00:44.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是藝術家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.05,0:00:46.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,藝術家？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.52,0:00:52.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是我的作品  主題是「喜悅」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.59,0:00:54.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喜悅…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.19,0:01:00.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是象徵清晨充滿希望的曙光
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.50,0:01:05.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真是前衛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.03,0:01:07.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:09.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但是  為什麼要換工作呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,而且還是來我們公司
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.58,0:01:13.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:17.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是追隨著發小冰室先生的腳步而來…之類的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.35,0:01:20.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不  絕無可能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.97,0:01:23.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嘛  說來話長啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.47,0:01:27.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,音無小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.39,0:01:32.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你打算休息到什麼時候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.16,0:01:35.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  音無小姐要喝咖啡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:36.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:39.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,接下來要出外勤  火鳥你趕緊做準備
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.98,0:01:42.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,音無小姐  等等我呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:46.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,跟小雛鳥似的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:02:00.85,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,900)\blur5\pos(1133.333,767.333)}第4話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:02:00.85,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fade(800,900)\pos(1305.333,839.999)}假日約會與雙人遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:06.49,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}冷たい指先感じられる距離感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:06.49,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}能感受到指尖冰涼的距離感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:12.57,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}もどかしくて少し切ない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:12.57,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}令人急不可待  又有些許愁緒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.27,0:02:18.58,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}ひとつずつ灯る街灯に呼応して
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.27,0:02:18.58,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}與一盞盞點亮的路燈遙相呼應
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:24.43,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}募っていく気持ちに気付いた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:24.43,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}覺察到心中一點點積攢的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.55,0:02:32.08,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,照れ隠してもクールぶっても {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.55,0:02:32.08,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,不管是遮羞  抑或是裝酷 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:34.97,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,見透かされそう {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:34.97,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,都像會被看透似的 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:38.13,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,やさしく {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:38.13,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,溫柔地 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:40.38,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Freeze for a minute {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:40.38,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,凍結一分鐘 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.47,0:02:43.39,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,心ごと {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.47,0:02:43.39,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,全心全意 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.55,0:02:49.51,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,I miss you 言わせたくて {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.55,0:02:49.51,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,想讓你說  我想你 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.74,0:02:52.67,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Let me love you honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.74,0:02:52.67,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,讓我愛你  honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.86,0:02:55.70,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,言えない for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.86,0:02:55.70,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,說不出口  for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:03:03.69,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,いつか言葉にできたら {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:03:03.69,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,假如有朝一日能說出口 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.91,0:03:32.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:42.28,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,全國首映
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:42.28,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,電影
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:42.28,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,小貓喬治2
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.86,0:03:44.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這張電影傳單…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:49.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是熱門動畫「小貓喬治」兒童頻道上的作品
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.32,0:03:53.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我姑且知道它改編成了電影
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.67,0:03:56.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.05,0:03:57.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:04.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你看到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.60,0:04:05.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:10.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我喜歡這個…因為可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:14.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也喜歡可愛的你！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.39,0:04:18.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,「小貓喬治1」的電影你看了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.68,0:04:19.16,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,看了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.98,0:04:21.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,其實去年上映的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:25.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我混在孩子和家長堆裡一個人去看的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.57,0:04:27.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好強
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:32.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,原來這麼有意思啊  我也去看看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.68,0:04:36.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我想了解冬月小姐喜歡的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.07,0:04:40.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要一起去看電影嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.60,0:04:45.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,下週「小貓喬治2」就上映了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.40,0:04:51.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可是  你沒看過第一部會不會沒那麼有意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.56,0:04:52.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不會的  我去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:54.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,第一部我會在家補的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:56.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那之後再聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.22,0:05:03.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,上次一起吃飯  這次是一起看電影
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:05.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,而且不是下班回家順路的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.99,0:05:07.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,而是在休息日  二人獨處
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.21,0:05:11.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,稱其為「約會」也不為過吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.09,0:05:17.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不行  人不能太飄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:22.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,把電影院凍上就完了  要保持冷靜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:28.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,「小貓喬治」真有意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.77,0:05:33.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,無論看多少次都很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:40.40,Koori-p1,,0,0,0,,{\p1\pos(59.6,215.6)\fscx119\fscy160}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:40.40,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(85.2,64.667)}冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:40.40,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(83.6,107.867)}-------------
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:40.40,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(79.867,146.267)}您有一條新信息
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:45.40,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\frz23.63\pos(754,477.2)}我看了喬治的第一部。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:45.40,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\frz23.2\pos(795.6,558.8)}特別好看。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.66,0:05:44.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我看了喬治的第一部
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.40,0:05:48.91,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\frz339.9\pos(710.8,531.6)}功課看來做足了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.40,0:05:48.91,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\frz339.9\pos(685.2,600.4)}我現在也在複習。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:48.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我現在也在複習
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:51.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐也在看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.93,0:05:54.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,兩個人在同一時間看同一部電影誒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:55.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:05:57.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我得先買好電影票
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.67,0:06:06.67,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(68,40)}電影票就由我來買吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.67,0:06:06.67,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(68,108)}因為是合家歡影片，我們就選牆邊的座位吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.67,0:06:06.67,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(62,180)}下午2點30分的那場可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.67,0:06:06.67,Koori-p1,,0,0,0,,{\p1\fscx298\fscy225\pos(35.6,255.6)}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.87,0:06:02.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,電影票就由我來買吧
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.88,0:06:06.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因為是合家歡影片  我們就選牆邊的座位吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.77,0:06:13.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐真周到  我就不客氣地交給她辦好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.93,0:06:15.68,Koori-picture4,,0,0,0,,{\an7}好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:15.68,Koori-picture4,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(78,32)}的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.68,0:06:19.44,Koori-p1,,0,0,0,,{\p1\fscx234\fscy216\pos(11.6,229.6)}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.68,0:06:19.44,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,134)}靠前、靠後和靠過道，你有偏好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.68,0:06:19.44,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(38,38)}還有稍貴一點的特等座。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:23.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,坐哪兒都行  只要和你坐在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:26.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你身邊就是我的特等座！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.36,0:06:30.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,糟了  直接將心聲打了出來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:31.70,Koori-p2,,0,0,0,,{\p1\fscx482\fscy561\pos(61.6,803.6)}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:31.70,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\fs100\pos(162,384)}坐哪兒都行。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:31.70,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\fs100\pos(154,552)}只要和你坐在一起，你身邊就是我的特等座
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:38.71,Koori-p2,,0,0,0,,{\p1\pos(513.6,751.6)\fscx245\fscy341}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:38.71,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\pos(540,459.334)}我對位置沒什麼講究。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:38.71,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\pos(544.667,571.334)}選冬月小姐覺得好的座位就行。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:44.71,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(156.667,719.333)}那我就選靠過道偏後的座位啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.94,0:06:44.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那我就選靠過道偏後的座位啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.47,0:06:52.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,說起來  看完電影後幹些什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:55.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,果然還是去吃飯嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.28,0:07:05.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但是…她只是邀請我去看電影而已
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.48,0:07:15.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,總之  看明天的氣氛再說  趕緊睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:17.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在看電影途中睡著了就糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:24.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,緊張到睡不著
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.86,0:07:30.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,該睡覺了  真期待明天呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.50,0:07:36.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,睡不著
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:41.76,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,爸爸  這邊這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.65,0:07:45.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.30,0:07:49.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你真早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.00,0:07:51.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,等很久了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.80,0:07:54.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.51,0:07:57.77,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒有沒有  我剛到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.11,0:07:59.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這樣呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:03.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,休息日和冬月小姐二人獨處不是夢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:05.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,心臟受到暴擊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:19.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是他們倆？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:24.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,休息日兩個人一起看電影啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.43,0:08:26.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,算了  我就一個人放鬆…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.89,0:08:28.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不好意思借過
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:31.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,火鳥先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.83,0:08:36.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,噢你是…是蛟島先生來著？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:38.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是冴島
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:43.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那個  你怎麼來看這部電影？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.07,0:08:45.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,正巧還在我旁邊的座位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.01,0:08:51.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這電影我一直想看  恰好空位只剩這裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:53.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.43,0:08:54.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:05.60,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,全國限定10萬張
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:05.60,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,觀眾禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:05.60,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,能獲得在電影裡登場的秘密明星卡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:08.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,挨著我坐呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:13.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,糟了  才播完預告我就心潮澎湃了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.41,0:09:15.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,得注意至少別讓這裡下雪了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.53,0:09:20.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可是  我究竟是為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.17,0:09:28.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要和剛認識的男同事在休息日兩人並坐地看「米」呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:40.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一個不留神沒收住
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:43.73,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.85,0:09:53.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.81,0:09:54.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喬治
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.47,0:09:59.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  喬治終於和媽媽重逢了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.74,0:10:03.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好虐  毫無尿點  好好看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:07.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,長大了重看還能有新體會
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:10.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,都是多虧了與冬月小姐的相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.46,0:10:21.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,得以體驗到以往人生中沒有的各種經歷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.03,0:10:25.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,「小貓喬治」也是  我一個人是絕不會來看的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.80,0:10:29.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,她哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:32.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這一幕確實感人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.19,0:10:35.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可是  她在哭誒…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:41.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦  紙巾  手帕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:54.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,謝謝…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:04.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我  是真的很喜歡她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:09.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生也哭了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.59,0:11:10.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的  很慚愧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.31,0:11:13.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因為太黑了  沒有注意到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.22,0:11:17.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生哭的時候會怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.75,0:11:20.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,開心的時候會出現雪人對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:22.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.04,0:11:25.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我能有機會見到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.47,0:11:32.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不過  能不哭是最好的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.78,0:11:34.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.47,0:11:37.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,說  說起來  關於接下來的行程
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.17,0:11:40.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要要要  要吃飯…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.22,0:11:45.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好像有點太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:47.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,確實
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:49.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那  那就
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.50,0:11:50.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那就喝個下午茶再回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.65,0:11:53.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,請務必
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.31,0:12:03.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好漫長啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.15,0:12:07.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不愧是長達3小時35分鐘的巨作
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.08,0:12:15.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,昨天的約會好開心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:19.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒想到今天卻要加班  落差好大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:23.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我還想好好回味回味的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.76,0:12:30.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.17,0:12:33.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  你也辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.65,0:12:36.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐也要加班嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:37.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.70,0:12:40.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我在等一個項目的回電
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:42.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生也加班嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:44.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:47.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也在等電話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.53,0:12:54.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雖然我原本覺得  要加班  好慘  心累
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.56,0:12:58.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但兩人獨處  加班  萬歲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.84,0:13:03.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我去泡點咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:05.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,麻煩你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:13.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  我過於心潮澎湃把咖啡凍上了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.87,0:13:15.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,請用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:16.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.02,0:13:35.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒人打電話來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.49,0:13:40.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,只是等電話而已  我也沒別的事可做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.39,0:13:41.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.76,0:13:43.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我們就老實在這兒等著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:48.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,其實今天狐森小姐邀請我去吃飯了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.76,0:13:50.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:54.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,說起來  她和狐森小姐關係真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:57.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我以要加班為由拒絕了她之後
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:14:00.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,她說會邀請其他人作為替代
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.16,0:14:03.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也是沒辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.01,0:14:07.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我可是沒辦法才邀請冴島先生你的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.71,0:14:10.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好  好  謝謝您嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.56,0:14:14.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哎呀  對於沒有什麼朋友的狐森小姐來說
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.08,0:14:16.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,肯陪你吃飯的我真是溫柔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.47,0:14:18.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喂  你這話是幾個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.22,0:14:22.00,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,幾個意思呀你小子…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.12,0:14:21.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不好意思  久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.69,0:14:28.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,音無小姐  火鳥先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:30.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,各位辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:33.26,Koori-p1,,0,0,0,,{\p1\pos(59.6,218.267)\fscx142\fscy177}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:33.26,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(90.001,100.666)}---------------
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:33.26,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(84.667,52.666)}狐森小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:33.26,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(87.333,151.334)}您有一條新信息
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.63,0:14:34.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,說曹操曹操到  是狐森小姐的信息
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.80,0:14:40.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和音無小姐他們會合了  玩得很開心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.25,0:14:44.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我得做點什麼讓冬月小姐打起精神來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.37,0:14:47.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我想想  有什麼呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.05,0:14:49.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你們看了什麼電影呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.10,0:14:51.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是一部叫「米」的電影
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.86,0:14:53.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是什麼電影
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.54,0:14:58.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一部以全CG描繪出擬人化的米的一生的豪華電影
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.41,0:15:01.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,高潮場面是壯觀的脫粒場景
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:04.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這電影…好看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.92,0:15:06.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎麼會想到去看這部電影的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.22,0:15:10.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是部熱議作品  網上的評價也很不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:12.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就想著去看看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.27,0:15:12.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是因為
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:16.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,音無小姐說自己喜歡吃米飯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:19.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是很喜歡米  不過只是喜歡吃罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.68,0:15:21.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,對脫粒什麼的並不是很…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:23.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,說起來那天
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.88,0:15:27.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我看見冰室先生和冬月小姐兩人單獨去看電影了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.85,0:15:29.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,什麼  那是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:31.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,也就是說他們去電影院約會了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:32.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.11,0:15:34.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他們會看什麼電影呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:38.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我只記得肯定不是「米」…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:42.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,有什麼  能讓冬月小姐打起精神來的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:44.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能讓她打起精神來的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:48.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  來玩詞語接龍嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.65,0:15:50.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,詞語接龍？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:55.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是不是有點幼稚呀  抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:58.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我想不到什麼別的有趣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:03.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,詞語接龍啊  在冬月小姐看來算是一件有趣的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:06.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這也太可愛了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.26,0:16:09.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不  這個主意很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.92,0:16:10.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我們玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:13.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(933.333,983.333)}shiritori
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:13.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那  從詞語接龍的ri開始
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.06,0:16:14.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(962.666,973.333)}risu
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.06,0:16:14.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,松鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.96,0:16:15.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(962.667,972.667)}surume
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.96,0:16:15.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,乾魷魚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:16.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(960,972.666)}mesu
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:16.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,手術刀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.73,0:16:17.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(962.667,975.333)}suika
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.73,0:16:17.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,西瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:18.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(962.666,975.333)}kakesu
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:18.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,樫鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:22.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,糟了  我下意識地就接了su結尾的詞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:27.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我在幹什麼啊  好像在對她使壞一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:31.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  果然
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.03,0:16:33.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,su  su…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:35.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我  我沒有…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.26,0:16:38.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是誤會  是誤會啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:42.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(936,980.667)}suki
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:42.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\pos(954.667,1056)}喜…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:47.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(968,972.667)}sukiyaki
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:47.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,壽喜燒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.37,0:16:48.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,壽喜燒？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.64,0:16:50.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嚇我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:53.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那天上映的電影有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.26,0:16:58.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,「小貓喬治」「米」「炸蝦殺手的挑戰」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.69,0:17:02.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,「花瓣般搖曳的戀愛」「冰原特快」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.90,0:17:06.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,「小貓喬治」是合家歡電影  肯定不是這部吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.28,0:17:10.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,如果是戀愛片  冰室先生的情緒一激動
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.33,0:17:12.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,電影院怕不是要遭殃吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:14.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那果然還是恐怖電影？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.89,0:17:19.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,無法想像他們倆害怕得尖叫的樣子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.43,0:17:22.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(968,972.667)}kinoko
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.43,0:17:22.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:22.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(962.666,975.333)}koara
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:22.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,考拉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:23.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(970.667,967.333)}rakko
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:23.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,海獺
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:24.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(965.334,964.667)}konbu
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:24.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,海帶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.10,0:17:26.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(973.334,972.666)}buririanto  katto
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.10,0:17:26.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,明亮式切割
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.49,0:17:29.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,「冰原特快」是什麼電影呀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:32.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在極寒的西伯利亞行駛的列車上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.52,0:17:35.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,偶然同乘一輛車的被爐匠人和溫泉專家…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:37.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這得有多巧合啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.50,0:17:41.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那就不知道了  總之就是由於剎車出了故障
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:46.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在失控的列車中  二人齊心協力逃出生天的動作片
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.75,0:17:51.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我記得  被爐工匠和溫泉專家在打破困境的過程中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.60,0:17:53.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,二人墜入愛河  最終喜結良緣了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.22,0:17:58.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  我知道這種橋段  叫做吊橋效應對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.09,0:18:03.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,兩個人一起逃出險境後就會愛上對方的套路
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.57,0:18:05.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,逃出險境…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:10.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,說到二人一起渡過危機  他們倆是還在加班吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.26,0:18:16.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,也就是說他們一起渡過加班的危機  再墜入愛河嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:17.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.00,0:18:19.76,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(968,914)}toruneedo
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.00,0:18:19.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,龍捲風
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.10,0:18:20.96,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(968,914)}doonatsu
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.10,0:18:20.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,甜甜圈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:22.26,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(978,922)}tsuinteeru
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:22.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雙馬尾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.65,0:18:23.88,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(968,920)}rukusenburuku
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.65,0:18:23.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,盧森堡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:25.25,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(960,918)}kurimanju
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:25.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,栗子饅頭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.88,0:18:26.94,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60}ushimitsudoki
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.88,0:18:26.94,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,三更半夜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.37,0:18:28.16,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,玩得好嗨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:28.81,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60}kiritanpo
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:28.81,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,切米糕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.88,0:18:31.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好想就這麼永遠接下去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.19,0:18:30.25,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60}poruchiinitake
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.19,0:18:30.25,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,牛肝菌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:37.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您好  我是冬月
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.15,0:18:38.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,電話打來了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:39.18,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.49,0:18:42.94,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,也就意味著冬月小姐之後要回家了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:43.03,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,好的  我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:46.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要是時間能稍稍停在這一刻就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.30,0:18:47.39,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,好的  再見
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:51.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  我…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.07,0:18:57.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你可以走了嗎  真好啊  辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.17,0:18:57.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:01.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,加班時間  延長了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.47,0:19:03.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那可真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:06.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,別太在意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.74,0:19:07.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.45,0:19:11.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.55,0:19:17.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你會不會有在打電話的時候隨手塗鴉的習慣？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.10,0:19:18.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,會有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:20.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.75,0:19:26.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我沒什麼繪畫的天賦  只能畫成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.63,0:19:27.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是豬嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.91,0:19:28.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是貓咪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:33.06,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,正在確認
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:33.06,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,稍後
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:33.06,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,回電
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:33.06,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,再等一會
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:31.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐畫的是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.67,0:19:32.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是熊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:38.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,接下來  我們玩你畫我猜吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.29,0:19:40.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:42.57,Koori-p1,,0,0,0,,{\p1\pos(59.6,218.267)\fscx142\fscy177}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:42.57,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(86,54)}冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:42.57,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(82,100)}---------------
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:42.57,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(84,148)}您有一條新信息
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.96,0:19:44.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:48.08,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(758,168)}我換頭像了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:47.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是什麼畫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:49.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:50.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是工作上的聯繫嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.63,0:19:53.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不  冬月小姐發來了好像是什麼畫的圖片
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.61,0:19:56.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.96,0:19:58.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他好像在消息轟炸我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:00.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,火鳥你聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:03.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你猜我這個頭像的肖像畫是誰畫的？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.47,0:20:04.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是冬月小姐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.05,0:20:07.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你猜冬月小姐的頭像是誰畫的？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.84,0:20:08.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.69,0:20:12.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我竟然  和冬月小姐互畫肖像畫了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.03,0:20:14.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.51,0:20:17.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,從前就人不可貌相  是個熱血男兒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.63,0:20:19.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但這句我必須要說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.96,0:20:21.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,恭  喜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.53,0:20:22.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,恭喜你啊  冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.19,0:20:28.94,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,火鳥先生  你在恭喜什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.21,0:20:32.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我的摯友冰室好像和冬月小姐有了不錯的進展
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:34.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,所以要恭喜他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.82,0:20:38.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生和冬月小姐有了不錯的進展？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.21,0:20:39.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,什麼不錯的進展
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:45.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不會是他們一起渡過加班危機後產生了吊橋效應吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.15,0:20:49.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,狐森小姐她們沒有回覆我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:50.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我這邊也是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.78,0:20:54.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,難得我們特地把頭像換成為彼此畫的肖像畫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:55.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好想聽聽他們的感想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:00.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您好  我是冬月
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.74,0:21:08.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您好  我是冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.11,0:21:11.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的  我明白了  再見
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.03,0:21:17.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這次應該能下班回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.43,0:21:19.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,應該是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.29,0:21:24.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要  要不  在回家路上去哪吃個飯？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.97,0:21:33.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我去拿下東西  你在出口等我一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.22,0:21:44.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天簡直最棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.37,0:21:50.33,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,他不接電話呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.59,0:21:51.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,什麼進展呀  恭喜什麼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.97,0:21:52.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,婚約？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.16,0:21:56.63,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,吊橋效應果然好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:56.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我感覺絕對不是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.45,0:22:20.98,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,ふと気づけばまた視線は　追い掛けてしまう君の姿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.45,0:22:20.98,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,突然發覺之時  視線又追逐上你的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.21,0:22:36.05,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,嫌なことがあっても心は　雨上がりの空のように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.21,0:22:36.05,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,即使遇上壞事  心也如雨後初晴的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:49.36,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,君の笑顔はどうしてこんなにも　ポカポカで温かいの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:49.36,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,你的笑容為何  如此和煦溫暖春風拂面
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.59,0:22:57.07,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　君のこと　何でもいいからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.59,0:22:57.07,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,告訴我可以嗎  只要是關於你什麼都行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.28,0:23:04.16,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,好きなこと　好きなもの　私にだけそっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.28,0:23:04.16,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,只悄悄告訴我  你喜歡的事也好物也罷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.38,0:23:11.77,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　いつの日か　二人のこの距離を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.38,0:23:11.77,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,告訴我可以嗎  總會有一天我們的距離
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.15,0:23:22.48,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,少しずつ　少しずつ　なんて少しだけ期待してる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.15,0:23:22.48,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,我無比期待著  它能一點一點日漸縮短
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.97,0:23:31.97,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,小貓喬治
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.97,0:23:31.97,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,集28分必得！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.49,0:23:34.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這  這是…
